    <guid isPermaLink="false">68131e3b47ebeede7e535420</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 01 May 2025 16:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期声音：</span><em><strong><span>Alex、大哥、老赵</span></strong></em></p><span></span><p><span>剪辑：Jeff</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="94">01:34</a> 厉害的大哥竟然做过有痛肠胃镜！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="423">07:03</a> 得过幽门螺旋杆菌的人，必须要做次肠胃镜检查；</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="713">11:53</a> 灌肠的药把大哥喝吐了……</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1369">22:49</a> 当天，Alex穿着睡衣到了医院，开始交代银行密码……</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1674">27:54</a> </span><em><strong><span>本期高潮来了！Alex麻醉醒来之后，不断的在跟全世界的人安利《苦尽柑来遇见你》……</span></strong></em></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2375">39:35</a> 总归还是越早检查越好，全凭年轻力壮；</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2629">43:49</a> 这部剧到底给我们带来了什么感同身受的体会？其中一个就是怎样表达自己的爱；所以，</span><em><strong><span>“一生要强的中国男人”能不能好好说话！</span></strong></em></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2942">49:02</a> 再到爱情，我们都想要“宽植”；</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3091">51:31</a> 这次全麻肠胃镜的几个tips。</span></p><span></span><p><span>-----------------------------</span></p><span></span><p><span>小红书：Alex小姐姐</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fj7WuPAcRNuLEHA3_16SOxBgnxKL.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>微信公众号：Alex的懒人沙发</span></p><span></span><p><span>联系Alex：86963821@qq.com</span></p>]]></description>
