  <item>
    <title>41-女司机</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67f33aca0decaeb09455480b</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">67f33aca0decaeb09455480b</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 07 Apr 2025 16:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期声音：Alex、</span><em><strong><span>思騎、凹凸曼</span></strong></em></p><span></span><p><span>剪辑：Jeff</span></p><span></span><p><span>录制时间：</span><em><strong><span>2025年3月23日</span></strong></em></p><span></span><p><strong><span>三位女司机驾龄：</span></strong><span>Alex 18年、曼姐20年、思騎25年</span></p><span></span><p><em><strong><span>时间码：</span></strong></em></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="256">04:16</a> 曼姐第一次路考没过；</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="550">09:10</a> 谁能想到，Alex是一个学小货车的B本司机；而思騎学的是1041大货车……</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="928">15:28</a> Alex和教练吵架的事；</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1511">25:11</a> 在导航还不发发达的年代，开车认路是必备技能；</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1766">29:26</a> 当女司机追尾后……</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2244">37:24</a> 曼姐大着肚子遇到了👮🏻叔叔</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2379">39:39</a> Alex惹怒了一位男司机，人生第一次拨打了110；</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3112">51:52</a> 回忆起721那天，我们都在路上……</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3717">01:01:57</a> 手绢能当雨刷吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span>-----------------------------</span></p><span></span><p><span>小红书：Alex小姐姐</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fj7WuPAcRNuLEHA3_16SOxBgnxKL.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>微信公众号：Alex的懒人沙发</span></p><span></span><p><span>联系Alex：86963821@qq.com</span></p>]]></description>
